From 6061bf47ffeb4dd16bb48df9e871284a3100f696 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gianni <giannirosato@proton.me>
Date: Sat, 3 Jan 2026 23:26:18 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] lavfi: add libssimu2 video filter using libssimu2

---
 configure                  |   4 +
 libavfilter/Makefile       |   1 +
 libavfilter/allfilters.c   |   1 +
 libavfilter/vf_libssimu2.c | 373 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 379 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 libavfilter/vf_libssimu2.c

